e><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta's</a> trading interface</li>\n<li>A row of books in <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster%27s_Library\" title=\"Elminster's Library\">Elminster's Library</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;9&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;102</span>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;4&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;100</span>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-6&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;110</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This publication describes itself in the introduction.]\n</p><p>‘A semiannual magazine of drawings and tales telling stories of famed heroes of Baldur’s Gate by their admirers, open to submissions from the public.’\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715020304\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1631/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26340/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6632/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua me